QuestGuidance.Register("en",203,{
[6465]="7005F6C3\n1\tIdle Longbeard explorers can be found along the western shore of Durthuzâram near Lugun-nâla and at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening. Believing it disrespectful, Spall has asked you to tell the dwarves to stop casting stones into Durthuzâram.\t\n2\tTalk to Spall at Lugun-nâla\tSpall can be found at Lugun-nâla in Gloomingtarn. You have told several idle Longbeard explorers to stop casting stones into Durthuzâram. You should return to Spall.\n",
[6466]="70047908\n1\tTalk to Ioreth in the High Hall\tIoreth can be found in the High Hall within the Masters' Tier of Minas Tirith (After-battle). Aragorn has asked you to return to Minas Tirith and learn of the fates of the wounded as well as what further havoc may have been wrought by Galathir's overeager hands.\n",
[6467]="700270FE\n1\tDefeat river-turtles (total: 6)\030Defeat dun-crows (total: 4)\tRiver-turtles and dun-crows roam the lands outside the cave to the Pristine Glade. Win has asked you to defeat foul monsters outside the cave entrance to the Pristine Glade to earn his trust. The only monsters, however, are river-turtles and dun-crows.\n2\tTalk to Win at the entrance to the Pristine Glade\tWin is at the entrance to the Pristine Glade. You should return to Win at the cave entrance and tell him the deed is done.\n",
[6468]="7005AABA\n1\tBreak drake eggs (total: 10)\tDrake eggs can be found throughout Borkordh, on the south-east side of the Pit of Stonejaws.\n2\tTalk to Molkha outside Borkordh\tMolkha is scouting outside the drake-nest of Borkordh in the south-east corner of the Pit of Stonejaws.\n",
[6469]="700350DB\n1\tDefeat Balewood overseers (total: 2)\tBalewood overseers can be found along the roadway through central Balewood. Húna wants you to defeat the strongest of the Orc-forces before engaging their leader along the Orc-roadway through the Balewood.\n2\tFind the leader of the White Hand forces on the Orc-roadway\tThe Orc-leader can be found along the roadway leading through central Balewood. Húna wants you to assault the leader of the White Hand forces under the cover of trees once you have found him.\n3\tDefeat Lomor\tLomor can be found along the Orc-roadway through central Balewood. Húna wants you to assault the leader of the White Hand forces, once you have lured him from the roadway, and slay him away from his ilk to discover any plans he may carry.\n4\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the Orc-leader and should now look over the crumpled note he carried.\n",
[6470]="7004A8D6\n1\tCaptain Róglarg can be found in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol. Práguk, Krúrglok, Lúksu, Danghát, and Shíkurz can be found throughout Cirith Ungol. Captain Róglarg has asked you to take over the duties of the Orcs that were slain in Dath Nethryn. You should speak to other Orcs in Cirith Ungol and learn what needs to be done.\t\n2\tReport to Captain Róglarg\tCaptain Róglarg can be found in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol. You have finished every task laid before you as the Silent One, and should now report back to Captain Róglarg.\n",
[6471]="7006D8FB\n1\tTalk to Rock\tBy completing this quest, you will receive a Shagâni Ghín barter currency allowance.\n",
